'''Angelic Beast Rajakong''' (超天獣ラジャコング, ''Chō Tenjū Rajakongu'', '''Super Heavenly Beast Rajakong''')  is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Angelic Gory]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]].

