==Trivia==
*Angelic Beast Rajakong's name, design (specifically the horns) and electrical attack are based off of ''Monster Hunter''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:monsterhunter:Rajang|Rajang]]. His [[Wave Attack]]s, lack of tail and resemblance to [[Ragin' Gory]] suggest that it is [[wikia:monsterhunter:Furious Rajang|Furious Rajang]] being referenced in particular.
**Rajakong also shares his white coloration with [[wikia:monsterhunter:Blangonga|Blangonga]], another speedy, simian [[wikia:monsterhunter:Fanged Beast|Fanged Beast]] that can attack by slamming the ground with both arms.
*Angelic Beast Rajakong's English description appears to have been mistranslated: it's phrased as though he can ''use'' both [[Wave Attack|Waves]] and Surges, when in actuality he is immune to both but can only use Waves. The original Japanese description only mentions that he is immune to Waves & Surges.

